---
description: >-
  A requirement and an element styled via classDef + `class` statement (the
  element gets one class, the requirement gets two) under the handDrawn look.
config:
  look: handDrawn
---
requirementDiagram

      requirement test_req {
      id: 1
      text: the test text.
      risk: high
      verifymethod: test
      }

      element test_entity {
      type: simulation
      }

      test_entity - satisfies -> test_req
      classDef bold font-weight: bold
      classDef blue stroke:lightblue, color: #0000FF
      class test_entity bold
      class test_req blue, bold
